  "description": "This is a recipe for spicy barbeque sauce. I let meat set overnight in the sauce. It makes a great marinade sauce. Its really spicy so if you don&#39;t like it so spicy leave out the pepper flakes. This also helps as a meat tenderizer. Enjoy!",
